 "VP Competitions, Ontario Engineering Competition 2028": "VP Wettbewerbe, Ontario Engineering Competition 2028",
 "Led a team of <strong>18 competition directors</strong> alongside <strong>2 co-VPs</strong> to plan and develop <strong>9 engineering competitions</strong>, anticipating an attendance of <strong>350+ undergraduate engineering students</strong> from <strong>16+ Ontario universities</strong>.": "Leitung eines Teams aus <strong>18 Wettbewerbsleitern</strong> gemeinsam mit <strong>2 Co-VPs</strong> zur Planung und Entwicklung von <strong>9 Ingenieurwettbewerben</strong>, mit erwarteten <strong>über 350 Ingenieurstudierenden</strong> von <strong>über 16 Universitäten in Ontario</strong>.",
 "Event Planning": "Eventplanung",
 "Communication": "Kommunikation",
 "Logistics": "Logistik",
 "Merchandise Director, Conference on Advocacy and Leadership in Engineering 2027": "Merchandise-Leiter, Conference on Advocacy and Leadership in Engineering 2027",
 "Negotiated with suppliers and sourced merchandise for the conference, coordinating product selection and procurement for <strong>100+ attendees</strong>.": "Verhandlungen mit Lieferanten und Beschaffung von Merchandise für die Konferenz, inklusive Produktauswahl und Einkauf für <strong>über 100 Teilnehmende</strong>.",
 "Negotiation": "Verhandlung",
